1707851033"],"description":"Veuve Clicquot. Ponsardin ha estado empujando fronteras durante los últimos 250 años. Desde la creación de champán rosado en 1775 para colaborar con innovadores como Andrée Putman y Campana Brothers, con cada siglo pasado la legendaria etiqueta va más allá y más allá para desafiarse con nuevas iniciativas para energizar y excitar a sus entusiastas. Cuando Madame Clicquot, que se había convertido en la veuve (widow) Clicquot Ponsardin, heredó la casa en 1805, siguió el lema “Sólo una calidad, la mejor” y creó la primera añada y el estante de enigmas, dos grandes innovaciones para champán producti","dept":"books","retailer":"assouline","specWeightKg":0.72,"url":"https://www.assouline.com/products/veuve-clicquot"}],"westcott fj400-se 400ws studio strobe (220v, au power cord)":[{"name":"Westcott FJ400-SE 400Ws Studio Strobe (220V, AU Power Cord)","brand":"Westcott","price":214.9,"image":"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/fb/westcott_4600_au_fj400_se_400ws_studio_strobe_1909923.jpg","images":["94|","34|multiple_images/images500x500/1754351623_IMG_2544292.jpg","85|3.jpg","85|4.jpg","85|5.jpg","85|6.jpg"],"description":"Flash de estudio Westcott.","dept":"electronics","retailer":"bhphoto","weightKg":2.75,"url":"https://www.bhphotovideo.com/c/product/1909923-REG/westcott_4600_au_fj400_se_400ws_studio_strobe.html"}],"zacro amphibious rc shark car for kids, waterproof 2.4ghz remote control stunt car, 360 flips all terrain toy truck with led lights, pool & land racing toy age 3+":[{"name":"Zacro Amphibious RC Shark Car for Kids, Waterproof 2.4GHz Remote Control Stunt Car, 360 Flips All Terrain Toy Truck with LED Lights, Pool & Land Racing Toy Age 3+","price":21.99,"image":"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Remote-Control-Car-Toy-Shark-Amphibious-RC-Car-for-Land-Water-4WD-Off-Road-Truck-Toy-Gift-for-Boys-Girls_975a0f24-35de-4fa7-98ab-5569fb026de3.1bcd085715c396ac8ca5af00b8d0be6d.png","description":"Juguete de auto de control remoto, auto RC anfibio ti